     The eett driver supports PCI Express Ethernet adapters based on the
     Agere/LSI ET1310 integrated MAC/PHY.

     The following _m_e_d_i_a types are supported:

     aauuttoosseelleecctt  Enable autoselection of the media type and options.
     1100bbaasseeTT     Set 10Mbps operation.
     110000bbaasseeTTXX   Set 100Mbps (Fast Ethernet) operation.
     11000000bbaasseeTT   Set 1000Mbps (Gigabit Ethernet) operation (some models only).

